  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moving the Middle II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to take the next step in creating a more inclusive Dutch society and fostering an attitude of openness and inclusion towards migrants in the Netherlands among the Movable Middle. This will be done by applying the products from Moving the Middle I, in particular the research results and messages included in the developed Knowledge Dossier and applying this in practice in an effort to contribute to a changed narrative. A national campaign, combined with local events, both tracked through continuous learning tools will further disseminate the lessons learned, tell us more about the effectiveness of the recommendations and messages developed so far, and actively engage the Movable Middle with messages developed for them.</narrative>
  </description>
